-- The four guides first written as files (apps/web/copy/blog) move into the database, so one place holds every
-- guide. They keep their wording and their publication dates and stay published as they were. An admin can
-- unpublish them before launch if the owner has not approved them yet (docs/growth-seo.md section 6).

insert into posts (slug, keyword, title, description, intro, sections, faq, related, status, published_at) values
  ($guide$car-hire-in-kenya-guide$guide$, $guide$car hire in Kenya$guide$, $guide$Car hire in Kenya: the complete guide$guide$, $guide$Everything to know before you hire a car in Kenya: self-drive or with a driver, which car type, how long, what you need, and how to avoid surprises.$guide$, $guide$Car hire in Kenya is simple once you know the choices: who drives, which car, for how long, and what you need to bring. This guide covers each one in plain words, so you can book car rental in Kenya with confidence and no surprises at pickup.$guide$,
   $guide$[{"id":"what-it-covers","heading":"What car hire in Kenya covers","paragraphs":["You pay a rental company for a car for a set number of days. Some companies are small and local, others run large fleets. What you get depends on the company, so it helps to compare the same car type and the same dates across more than one.","Most hire falls into three kinds: [car hire](/car-hire) for yourself or with a driver, [airport and corporate transfers](/transfers) where a driver takes you from A to B, and [cars for events](/events) such as weddings, shoots and convoys."]},{"id":"who-drives","heading":"Who will drive: you or a chauffeur","paragraphs":["Self-drive gives you the car and the freedom to go where you like. A chauffeur-driven car comes with a driver from the rental company, so you can rest, work or avoid unfamiliar roads. Kenya drives on the left, which is worth remembering if you are visiting.","We wrote a separate guide on [choosing between self-drive and chauffeur-driven car hire](/blog/self-drive-or-chauffeur-driven-car-hire-kenya)."]},{"id":"car-type","heading":"Choosing the right car type","paragraphs":["Think about people, luggage and roads, in that order. Car types differ from company to company, so check seats and luggage space on the car page."],"items":["Economy and hatchback cars suit town driving, couples and small families.","A luxury car, such as a premium SUV, suits weddings, VIP transfers and special occasions.","A sedan is comfortable for business, airport runs and longer drives.","An SUV gives more room and better clearance for upcountry roads.","A van carries groups, and a tour van is built for safaris and group tours."]},{"id":"how-long","heading":"How long to hire for","paragraphs":["You can hire by the day, the weekend, the week or the month. Longer hire usually costs less per day, because discounts for a week, a month or more apply to the price. A very short hire may be charged at the rental company's minimum period, and your quote shows it before you ask."]},{"id":"what-you-need","heading":"What you need to hire a car","paragraphs":["A valid driving licence and an ID or passport are the basics for self-drive. Age and driving-experience rules depend on the car type. Our guide lists the [documents you need to rent a car in Kenya](/blog/documents-needed-to-rent-a-car-in-kenya)."]},{"id":"before-you-drive","heading":"Before you drive away","paragraphs":["A few minutes at handover can save an argument at return."],"items":["Walk around the car with the rental company and photograph every side, with the date visible.","Check the tyres, including the spare and the jack, and test the lights and wipers.","Note the fuel level and ask which fuel the car takes.","Make sure existing marks are written on the handover record.","Ask what the insurance covers, what you pay if something happens, and who to call."]},{"id":"booking","heading":"How booking works on Carvo","paragraphs":["Choose your dates and a car on [the car list](/cars) and see the full price before you ask. The rental company confirms your request, and you sign the agreement online. For now no deposit is taken when you book. [Read how the price is built](/blog/how-much-does-car-rental-cost-in-kenya)."]}]$guide$::jsonb,
   $guide$[{"q":"Is it cheaper to hire a car for a month?","a":"Often, per day. Discounts for longer hire apply to the price and appear as their own line in your quote."},{"q":"Can I hire a car with a driver in Kenya?","a":"Yes. Choose chauffeur-driven when you search. The cost of the driver is shown before you ask."},{"q":"Do I pay a deposit to hire a car?","a":"Not on Carvo for now. No deposit is taken when you book, and the price you see is the full price."},{"q":"Can I hire a car for just one day?","a":"Yes, though a very short hire may be charged at a minimum hire period. Your quote shows exactly what you will pay."}]$guide$::jsonb,
   $guide$[{"label":"Browse car hire","href":"/car-hire"},{"label":"See all cars","href":"/cars"}]$guide$::jsonb,
   'published', '2026-11-23T09:00:00+03:00'),
  ($guide$self-drive-or-chauffeur-driven-car-hire-kenya$guide$, $guide$chauffeur-driven car hire$guide$, $guide$Self-drive or chauffeur-driven car hire in Kenya: which is right?$guide$, $guide$Not sure whether to drive yourself or hire a driver in Kenya? Compare cost, comfort, safety and flexibility, and pick the option that suits your trip.$guide$, $guide$The first choice in car hire is who drives. Self-drive gives you freedom, while chauffeur-driven car hire gives you time and ease. Here is how to decide between them for your trip in Kenya, in plain terms.$guide$,
   $guide$[{"id":"what-each-means","heading":"What each option means","paragraphs":["With self-drive you collect the car, drive it yourself and return it. You need a valid licence and an ID or passport. With a chauffeur, a driver from the rental company takes the wheel and you travel as a passenger.","Both are part of [car hire in Kenya](/blog/car-hire-in-kenya-guide), and you can search for either on our [car hire page](/car-hire)."]},{"id":"self-drive-suits","heading":"When self-drive suits you","paragraphs":["Self-drive is a good fit when freedom and cost matter most."],"items":["You want to set your own route and stops, especially on a road trip.","You are comfortable on the roads and with the driving style where you are going.","You want to keep the cost down, since there is no driver to pay for.","You are travelling in a small group that can share the driving."]},{"id":"chauffeur-suits","heading":"When a chauffeur suits you","paragraphs":["A driver is worth considering when time, comfort or unfamiliar roads matter more than cost."],"items":["You land after a long flight and would rather not drive straight away. See [airport transfers](/transfers).","You have meetings or a full day and want to work or rest between stops.","You are new to the roads, or to driving on the left.","You are hosting guests, or the car is for an event such as a wedding. See [cars for events](/events)."]},{"id":"cost","heading":"How cost compares","paragraphs":["A chauffeur adds a cost for the driver, and that cost is shown before you ask, so you can compare like with like. Self-drive has no driver cost, but you take responsibility for the car while you have it. Remember to include fuel and parking when you compare, whichever you choose."]},{"id":"responsibility","heading":"Who is responsible for the driver","paragraphs":["On Carvo the rental company is responsible for checking its drivers. When a car comes with a chauffeur, the company confirms that the driver is licensed and that its insurance covers chauffeur use. It is still sensible to ask the company how it vets and trains its drivers."]},{"id":"mix","heading":"You can mix the two","paragraphs":["Many trips use both. A chauffeur for the airport arrival and the city days, then a self-drive car for a few days away. You can book each part separately and choose the services you need in the search."]}]$guide$::jsonb,
   $guide$[{"q":"Is chauffeur-driven car hire much more expensive?","a":"It costs more than self-drive because of the driver. The driver cost is shown on its own before you ask."},{"q":"Can I switch from self-drive to a chauffeur after booking?","a":"Dates can be changed once, up to 24 hours before pickup. For a different service, make a new request or ask the rental company."},{"q":"Do I need a licence for a chauffeur-driven car?","a":"No, because you are not driving. You still need an ID or passport to book."}]$guide$::jsonb,
   $guide$[{"label":"Chauffeur-driven and self-drive cars","href":"/car-hire"},{"label":"Airport and corporate transfers","href":"/transfers"}]$guide$::jsonb,
   'published', '2026-11-23T09:00:00+03:00'),
  ($guide$documents-needed-to-rent-a-car-in-kenya$guide$, $guide$documents you need to rent a car in Kenya$guide$, $guide$Documents you need to rent a car in Kenya$guide$, $guide$The short list of documents you need to rent a car in Kenya, how to upload them, and what to check before you book, for residents and visitors.$guide$, $guide$The documents you need to rent a car in Kenya are short: a valid driving licence and an ID or passport. This guide explains what to have ready, how uploading works, and the questions to ask if your situation is unusual.$guide$,
   $guide$[{"id":"the-short-list","heading":"The short list","paragraphs":["For a self-drive hire you will usually need:"],"items":["A valid driving licence in your name, with the licence not expired.","A national ID, or your passport if you are visiting.","An email address, so the rental company can reach you."]},{"id":"visitors","heading":"If you are visiting Kenya","paragraphs":["Bring your passport and the driving licence from your home country. If your licence is not in English, ask the rental company before you travel whether it needs a translation or an International Driving Permit. Rules and company policies differ, so it is better to ask early than to find out at pickup."]},{"id":"age-and-experience","heading":"Age and driving experience","paragraphs":["Minimum age and how long you have held your licence can depend on the car type. These rules are shown before you request a booking, so you will not be surprised later. A larger or more powerful car may ask for more experience than a small one."]},{"id":"uploading","heading":"How uploading works on Carvo","paragraphs":["You upload your ID and licence as a photo or PDF, in JPG, PNG or PDF format, up to 10 MB each. Take the photo in good light, with all four corners visible and the text sharp. Blurry or cropped photos are the most common reason a check takes longer.","Your documents are private. Staff must give a reason to open one, and every time one is opened it is logged."]},{"id":"problems","heading":"Common problems, and how to avoid them","paragraphs":["Most delays come from small things that are easy to fix before you book."],"items":["An expired licence: check the date now, not at the counter.","A name that does not match: use your name exactly as it appears on your licence and ID.","A blurry or cropped photo: retake it in daylight, with the whole card visible.","A licence you have held for a short time: some car types ask for more experience, so check before you choose."]},{"id":"signing","heading":"Signing the agreement","paragraphs":["Once the rental company confirms your booking, you sign the rental agreement online. You tick, type your name, and can add a drawn signature. You keep a copy of the signed agreement. Read it once before you sign: it sets out the rules for the car, fuel and returning it."]},{"id":"chauffeur","heading":"If you are not driving","paragraphs":["For a car with a chauffeur, or for [airport transfers](/transfers), you do not need a driving licence because you are a passenger. You still need an ID or passport to book. See [chauffeur-driven or self-drive](/blog/self-drive-or-chauffeur-driven-car-hire-kenya) if you are deciding."]}]$guide$::jsonb,
   $guide$[{"q":"Can I rent a car in Kenya without a passport?","a":"Kenyan residents can use their national ID. Visitors use a passport. Either way you need a valid driving licence for self-drive."},{"q":"Do I need to print my documents?","a":"No. You upload photos or PDFs online. Keep the originals with you at pickup in case the rental company asks to see them."},{"q":"Are my documents safe?","a":"They are stored privately. Staff must give a reason to open one, and each time is logged."}]$guide$::jsonb,
   $guide$[{"label":"Hire a car","href":"/car-hire"},{"label":"The complete guide to car hire in Kenya","href":"/blog/car-hire-in-kenya-guide"}]$guide$::jsonb,
   'published', '2026-11-23T09:00:00+03:00'),
  ($guide$how-much-does-car-rental-cost-in-kenya$guide$, $guide$car rental in Kenya$guide$, $guide$Car rental in Kenya: what it costs and what decides the price$guide$, $guide$What decides the price of car rental in Kenya, how longer hire changes it, and how to compare quotes fairly so you pay for what you actually need.$guide$, $guide$Prices for car rental in Kenya vary, and the reason is not mysterious. A handful of things decide the price, and once you know them you can compare quotes fairly. This guide explains them without guessing at numbers, because the right price is the one in your quote for your dates.$guide$,
   $guide$[{"id":"daily-rate","heading":"It starts with the daily rate","paragraphs":["Every car type has a daily rate, and the hire price is that rate for each day you keep the car. A small car costs less per day than an SUV or a van, because it is a smaller asset and carries fewer people."]},{"id":"what-changes-it","heading":"What changes the price","paragraphs":["These are the things that move a quote up or down."],"items":["The car type: seats, size and how much it costs to run.","The length of hire: longer hire can mean a lower rate per day.","A driver: a chauffeur is an added cost, shown on its own.","Delivery: bringing the car to you is priced by area.","Extras: things you add, such as a child seat, are charged separately.","The dates: availability and the season can affect what is on offer."]},{"id":"longer-hire","heading":"How longer hire changes the price","paragraphs":["Discounts for a week, a month or more are applied to the hire price, and the best one for your stay appears as its own named line. That is why a month can cost much less per day than a weekend. See [car hire by the day, week or month](/car-hire)."]},{"id":"compare","heading":"How to compare quotes fairly","paragraphs":["Two quotes only compare if they cover the same thing. Check each one for:"],"items":["The same dates, pick-up time and return time.","The same car type and number of seats.","Whether a driver is included.","Whether delivery and extras are in the price or added later.","Fuel policy, any limit on distance, and what the insurance covers and what you pay if something happens."]},{"id":"save","heading":"Simple ways to pay less","paragraphs":["Choose the smallest car that comfortably carries your people and luggage. Hire for the full period you need, since longer hire can lower the daily rate. Decline extras you will not use. If your dates are flexible, search a few and see what is free."]},{"id":"carvo","heading":"What a Carvo quote shows","paragraphs":["You see the price line by line: the car hire, any discount, delivery and extras. For now no deposit is taken when you book, so the price you see is the full price. Start on [the car list](/cars), or read the [complete guide to car hire in Kenya](/blog/car-hire-in-kenya-guide)."]}]$guide$::jsonb,
   $guide$[{"q":"Why is a small car cheaper than an SUV?","a":"Smaller cars cost less to buy and run, so their daily rate is lower. An SUV carries more people and luggage."},{"q":"Is the daily rate the final price?","a":"Not always. Delivery, a driver and extras are added as their own lines, and discounts for longer hire are taken off. Your quote shows all of it."},{"q":"Is there a deposit on top of the price?","a":"Not on Carvo for now. No deposit is taken when you book."}]$guide$::jsonb,
   $guide$[{"label":"See car types and daily rates","href":"/cars"},{"label":"Car hire by the day, week or month","href":"/car-hire"}]$guide$::jsonb,
   'published', '2026-11-23T09:00:00+03:00');
